.TH MYSTRNCPY 1 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy a bounded number of characters from a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrncpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ", int " n ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrncpy()
function copies at most
.I n
characters from the string pointed to by
.I src
into the buffer pointed to by
.IR dest .
If
.I src
is shorter than
.I n
characters, the remainder of
.I dest
is not guaranteed to be null-padded unless implemented to do so.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, or \-1 on failure.
